Today all my work is complete.
Now I am hungry.
I am thirsty too.
There is a tea stall on the street.
There are many people there.
I go there.
The shopkeeper is very busy.
I say, "Brother, give me one vada pav."
"Also give a cutting chai."
The shopkeeper says, "You wait here."
He gives the vada pav quickly.
He also gives the cutting chai.
The vada pav is hot.
I eat it.
It is very spicy.
I drink the cutting chai.
It is very sweet.
Now I have an Indian mobile number.
I am very happy.
My life in Mumbai is good now.
